# Shell scripts are bind-mounted into Linux containers (see docker-compose.yml,
# keycloak-init). With core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout gives them CRLF
# line endings, the container reads the shebang as "/bin/sh\r", and the run dies
# with "not found" — which looks like a missing file, not a line-ending bug.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
